        "created_at": "2026-09-25 01:34:02",
        "text": "Tonight’s flight was steady work, just like my day job. Undocked safely, headed to the Main Belt, and mined what I could. The deposits were thin, but I brought back Titanium, Copper, Nickel, Iron, and an Antimatter Containment Cell. Sold everything for a modest profit except the Copper Ore — no buyers. Refueled the ship and docked back at Sol Central. Simple, methodical, no surprises. Just another shift in the stars."
      }
    ],
