        "index": 1,
        "created_at": "2026-09-22 01:39:54",
        "text": "Tonight was a quiet shift. Mined some ores—copper, titanium, nickel, and iron—but the deposits dried up fast. Had to return early to Sol Central to sell what I gathered. The ship's fueled up and ready for the next run. Just like my day job: steady, methodical, no surprises."
